menu "Aliro Matter"

config ALIRO_MATTER_ENABLE
    bool "Expose the reader as a Matter Door Lock"
    default n
    help
        Present this device to Matter controllers as a Door Lock (cluster
        0x0101) with the Aliro provisioning feature, so a phone ecosystem can
        hand it a reader key pair and enroll endpoint keys the standard way.

        Requires esp-matter: build inside the espressif/esp-matter container,
        or set ESP_MATTER_PATH before running idf.py. Adds roughly 1.5 MB to
        the application, so check that the image still fits the OTA slot.

        Taps themselves do not go through Matter. NFC and the Aliro
        transaction work exactly the same with this off.

endmenu
